The '''Galactic Barrier''' was a cosmic bramble of [[Hyperspace anomaly|hyperspace anomalies]] that bisected the galaxy west of the [[Deep Core]], forming the western edge of explored space and separating it from the [[Unknown Regions]]. The barrier prevented exploration of the Unknown Regions since the advent of the [[hyperdrive]] technology and the dawn of galactic civilization, save for a few worlds which could be reached with cautious [[hyperspace]] jumps, including [[Csilla]], [[Ilum]], and [[Rakata Prime]]. The ancient [[Sith]] and [[Jedi]] discovered ways to navigate the anomalies, but their methods were lost to [[time]], with routes only left in artifacts such as [[Sith wayfinder|Sith]] [[wayfinder]]s and [[Jedi star compass]]es.<ref name="TROS VD" />

